# Build context denylist — keeps host artifacts out of every image layer.
# Host .venv must NEVER enter an image (spec R3); source and deps are baked
# lock-exact by uv sync --frozen inside the Containerfile stages instead.
.git/
**/.venv/
.local/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
frontend/
scripts/
openspec/
PORTFOLIO.md
